{
  "name": "Service client 01 - Réception des e-mails",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 01 · Réception des e-mails\n\nChaque minute, relève les e-mails **non lus** envoyés à l'adresse du service client, les fait traiter un par un par le workflow 03, puis les marque comme lus.\n\n**À régler** : votre compte Gmail, l'adresse du service client dans le filtre (`to:…`), et le workflow 03 dans « Traiter la demande (03) ».",
        "width": 760,
        "height": 220,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "04fb9f56-7629-58d8-8658-793eed3dbe96",
      "name": "Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        },
        "simple": false,
        "filters": {
          "q": "to:service-client@votre-boutique.fr",
          "readStatus": "unread"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "9e696254-f1d9-58ab-becc-6072496692ba",
      "name": "Nouvel e-mail au service client",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmailTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "// E-mail reçu (Gmail, format complet) -> message à traiter.\nconst e = $json;\nconst de = (e.from && e.from.value && e.from.value[0]) || {};\nconst entetes = {};\nfor (const [k, v] of Object.entries(e.headers || {})) entetes[String(k).toLowerCase()] = String(v);\nconst zone = 'Europe/Paris';\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    canal: 'email',\n    texte: e.text || e.html || e.textAsHtml || '',\n    de_email: String(de.address || '').toLowerCase(),\n    de_nom: de.name || '',\n    sujet: e.subject || '',\n    message_id: e.messageId || e.id || '',\n    recu_le: e.date ? DateTime.fromJSDate(new Date(e.date)).setZone(zone).toISO({ suppressMilliseconds: true })\n      : DateTime.now().setZone(zone).toISO({ suppressMilliseconds: true }),\n    entetes,\n    chat: null,\n    gmail_id: e.id || '',\n  },\n};\n"
      },
      "id": "0cee8e8a-b046-5a5a-b203-71ec68776861",
      "name": "Normaliser l'e-mail",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "source": "database",
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "mode": "each",
        "options": {
          "waitForSubWorkflow": true
        }
      },
      "id": "35c8d3aa-facf-575f-b95d-9913fb9b9899",
      "name": "Traiter la demande (03)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        100
      ],
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "return $('Normaliser l\\'e-mail').all().map(i => ({ json: { gmail_id: i.json.gmail_id } }));\n"
      },
      "id": "d2be62be-8e84-514c-a50b-f172632e1c31",
      "name": "E-mails traités",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        660,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "markAsRead",
        "messageId": "={{ $json.gmail_id }}"
      },
      "id": "bc4f4aa4-4b7f-5396-be1e-499d90b8abc4",
      "name": "Marquer comme lu",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        880,
        100
      ]
    }
  ],
